              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 52px;">
                <td style="height: 52px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>Lateral pterygoid</bold>
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Superior head: greater wing of sphenoid bone; inferior head: lateral pterygoid plate's lateral aspect</td>
                <td style="height: 52px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Superior head: joint capsule and articular disc of&#x000a0;temporomandibular joint; inferior head: pterygoid fovea (on neck of mandibular condyloid process)</td>
                <td style="height: 52px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Bilaterally: protrude the mandible and lower the chin; unilaterally: produce side-to-side mandibular movements (chewing)</td>
              </tr>
