              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>Medications</bold>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Preoperative antibiotics (eg, weight-based ampicillin-sulbactam); Postoperative antibiotics (eg, coamoxiclav for 5-7 days); Pain management (eg,&#x000a0;over-the-counter acetaminophen and ibuprofen)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x000a0;<bold>Miscellaneous</bold></td>
